    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup\n**SMS (phone):** SMS to URL Forwarder app (F-Droid), sender Similarweb, text filter \"Similarweb account verification code\", webhook = this workflow's production URL, header X-Sms-Token (value checked in \"Prepare SMS fields\"). Wrong token or other senders are dropped.\n\n**Email:** Outlook trigger on Antonio's mailbox polls every minute for mail from noreply@similarweb.com; only \"Reset my password\" emails are posted, once per message id.",
        "height": 224,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "c256c0c9-36e1-4aaf-8efd-b310d540ba8a",
      "name": "Sticky Note ff08a9c8",
